r Friday.</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-end" data-testid="bubble-agent" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[75%]"><div class="rounded-2xl px-3.5 py-2 text-sm shadow-xs rounded-br-sm bg-primary-soft text-foreground"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Hi Sarah! Yes, I can see your booking - Friday 7pm, 120 pax.</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-check size-3.5 text-info" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="tick-read"><path d="M18 6 7 17l-5-5"></path><path d="m22 10-7.5 7.5L13 16"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-center" data-testid="bubble-system" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-amber-900 dark:border-amber-900/50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 dark:text-amber-200"><div class="mb-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sticky-note size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"></path><path d="M15 3v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path></svg>Internal note · Demo User · HH:MM</div><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">VIP client - handle with priority. Decision maker is Sarah.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-start" data-testid="bubble-contact" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[75%]"><div class="rounded-2xl px-3.5 py-2 text-sm shadow-xs rounded-bl-sm bg-muted text-foreground"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Great. One more thing -</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-start" data-testid="bubble-contact" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[75%]"><div class="rounded-2xl px-3.5 py-2 text-sm shadow-xs rounded-bl-sm bg-muted text-foreground"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Can I change my booking to Saturday?</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-end" data-testid="bubble-agent" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[75%]"><div class="rounded-2xl px-3.5 py-2 text-sm shadow-xs rounded-br-sm bg-primary-soft text-foreground"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Checking availability now, give me a minute 🙏</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-check size-3.5 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="tick-delivered"><path d="M18 6 7 17l-5-5"></path><path d="m22 10-7.5 7.5L13 16"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-end" data-testid="bubble-agent" data-state="closed" data-slot="context-menu-trigger"><div class="max-w-[75%]"><div class="rounded-2xl px-3.5 py-2 text-sm shadow-xs rounded-br-sm bg-primary-soft text-foreground"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Saturday 7pm is free - shall I move it?</p><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-2xs text-muted-foreground">HH:MM<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg